<title>UK: Golden Land proposes 7.4 mln stg cash call.</title>
<headline>Golden Land proposes 7.4 mln stg cash call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golden Land Investments Plc said on Wednesday it had proposed a rights issue to raise around 7.4 million stg to fund acquisitions in the UK and China, to repay debt and to provide working capital.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that it would offer 20 new shares at 21 pence each for every 17 shares held.</p>
<p>The rights issue is partially underwritten by Fiske &amp; Co.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
